        {
          "id": "GH-04-K03-check-q1",
          "type": "single",
          "question": "函数 y = sin(3x) 由外层函数 y = sin(u) 和内层函数 u = 3x 复合而成。根据链式法则，该复合函数的导数 y' 的正确表达式是哪一个？",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "A",
              "label": "y' = cos(3x)"
            },
            {
              "value": "B",
              "label": "y' = 3cos(3x)"
            },
            {
              "value": "C",
              "label": "y' = cos(3) + sin(x)"
            },
            {
              "value": "D",
              "label": "y' = -3sin(3x)"
            }
          ],
          "answer": [
            "B"
          ],
          "analysis": "链式法则的核心含义是：复合函数对自变量的导数，等于外层函数对中间变量的导数乘以中间变量对自变量的导数。本题中，外层 sin(u) 对 u 的导数是 cos(u)，内层 u = 3x 对 x 的导数是 3。因此 y' = cos(u) · 3 = 3cos(3x)。选项 A 只求了外层导数而漏乘内层导数，是典型的常见误解；选项 C 错误拆分了复合结构；选项 D 符号计算错误。",
          "points": 10,
          "knowledgePointIds": [
            "GH-04-K03"
          ],
          "cognitiveLevel": "apply",
          "estimatedSteps": 3,
          "pairId": "GH-04-K03-check-pair",
          "adaptiveRole": "core",
          "equivalence": {
            "presentationMode": "symbolic",
            "knownConditionCount": 2,
            "operationCount": 2,
            "symbolComplexity": "low",
            "conclusionClass": "formula-derivation"
          }
